# p_5b81 — Weekday evening vacuum: living room floor, 18:00 to 19:30

The vacuum cleaner sits at the entry floor for the entire day on weekdays. Omar is home in the morning but does not vacuum; the machine stays in its resting spot by the door. When Yuki arrives at 17:30, she pulls the vacuum out around 18:00 and uses it in the living room for roughly an hour — the 18:00 pass catches it at both the entry (still being carried) and the living room floor, and the 19:00 pass shows it squarely on the living room floor. By 19:30 it is back at the entry floor for the night.

This document predicts the vacuum on the living room floor specifically between 18:00 and 19:30 on weekdays, and at the entry floor at all other hours. It is set apart from p_f5a7 (which also places it on the floor at 18–19:30) by the explicit return-to-entry prediction at 20:00 and the all-day entry-floor resting spot. A sighting of the vacuum on the living room floor at 10:00 or 14:00 would refute this document.

